# AVI ELF II / Hyperboard help, first-stage development ROM.
# This does not guarantee hardware compatibility.
AVI ELF II / HYPERBOARD - DEVELOPMENT ROM
NOT YET HARDWARE-SAFE: UART, RTC/NVR, IDE, cassette unported.
NO EEPROM PROGRAMMING until startup/BIOS port and tests.

PROGRAM CONTROL
    CALL addr              -- call program using SCRT
    RUN [addr]             -- run with P=0
    CONT[inue]             -- resume after break

LANGUAGES / DEBUG (PENDING TEST)
    BAS[ic] [NEW|OLD]     -- rc/BASIC Level 2
    ASM [NEW|OLD]        -- editor/assembler

MEMORY / I-O
    E[xamine] addr [end]  -- inspect memory
    D[eposit] addr data.. -- write memory
    IN[put] port          -- I/O read
    OU[tput] port data    -- I/O write
    :llaaaattdddd..cc     -- Intel HEX input

OTHER
    HEL[p]                -- show help
    SH[ow] EF             -- read EF inputs
    TE[st] RAM           -- memory test

SEDIT, VISUAL/02, FORTH, VT1802 omitted; space reserved.
TBASIC, CDP1854 console and cassette not yet implemented.
Stock-only commands may still exist; DO NOT use unported
disk, RTC/NVR or 8250 UART paths on AVI hardware.
